@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<style>
    body {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #06b6d4 100%);
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .privacy-container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 50px auto;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        padding: 50px;
    }

    .privacy-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        padding-bottom: 25px;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #0ea5e9;
    }

        .privacy-header h1 {
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .privacy-header p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

    .privacy-section {
        margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

        .privacy-section h2 {
            color: #0ea5e9;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .privacy-section h3 {
            color: #334155;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .privacy-section p {
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-align: justify;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .privacy-section ul {
            margin-left: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .privacy-section li {
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

    .highlight-box {
        background: #f0f9ff;
        border-left: 5px solid #0ea5e9;
        padding: 25px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

        .highlight-box h3 {
            color: #0369a1;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .highlight-box p {
            color: #0c4a6e;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .highlight-box ul {
            margin-top: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .highlight-box li {
            color: #0c4a6e;
        }

    .warning-box {
        background: #fef3c7;
        border-left: 5px solid #f59e0b;
        padding: 25px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

        .warning-box h3 {
            color: #92400e;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .warning-box p {
            color: #78350f;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

    .icon {
        font-size: 26px;
    }

    .contact-section {
        background: #f8fafc;
        border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 30px;
        margin-top: 40px;
        text-align: center;
    }

        .contact-section h3 {
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact-section p {
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .contact-section a {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0ea5e9;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

            .contact-section a:hover {
                background: #0284c7;
            }
</style>

<div class="privacy-container">
    <div class="privacy-header">
        <h1><span>🏥</span> Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last Updated: March 25, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><span class="icon">📋</span> Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Welcome to MediReport Patient Report Generator. We understand the critical importance of patient data privacy
            and confidentiality in healthcare. This Privacy Policy explains how our application handles medical documents
            and patient information during the report generation process.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our application is designed as a document processing tool that helps healthcare professionals generate
            professional patient reports by merging Word document templates with patient data. We are committed to
            maintaining the highest standards of data security and privacy.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><span class="icon">🔒</span> Information We Process</h2>
        <p>When you use our patient report generation service, we temporarily process the following information:</p>

        <h3>Medical Document Templates</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Word document templates (.doc, .docx, .dot, .dotx, .docm, .dotm)</li>
            <li>Report templates containing merge fields for patient information</li>
            <li>Custom healthcare document formats</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Patient Data Files</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>XML files containing patient information and medical records</li>
            <li>Structured data including patient demographics, medical history, diagnoses, and treatment details</li>
            <li>Multiple patient records for batch processing</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Generated Reports</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Merged PDF documents containing patient-specific information</li>
            <li>Single consolidated PDF reports or multiple individual patient reports</li>
            <li>Formatted medical documentation ready for clinical use</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><span class="icon">⚙️</span> How We Process Your Data</h2>
        <p>
            Our application uses Syncfusion DocIO library to perform mail merge operations and document conversion.
            The processing workflow is as follows:
        </p>

        <h3>Document Processing Steps:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Upload:</strong> Your Word template and XML data file are uploaded to the server's temporary memory</li>
            <li><strong>Mail Merge:</strong> Syncfusion DocIO performs mail merge operations to populate template fields with patient data</li>
            <li><strong>Format Detection:</strong> The system automatically detects whether to use simple mail merge, group merge, or nested group merge based on your data structure</li>
            <li><strong>PDF Conversion:</strong> The merged document is converted to PDF format using Syncfusion DocIORenderer</li>
            <li><strong>Output Generation:</strong> Based on your selection, either a single merged PDF or multiple individual PDFs are created</li>
            <li><strong>Download:</strong> The generated PDF(s) are immediately sent to your browser for download</li>
            <li><strong>Cleanup:</strong> All temporary files and data are immediately deleted from server memory</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="warning-box">
        <h3><span>⚠️</span> Important Note</h3>
        <p>
            All processing happens locally in your browser, and files <strong>never</strong>
            go to any server. Everything stays private and secure on your machine. ✔️
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-section">
        <h3>📧 Questions or Concerns?</h3>
        <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle medical document processing,
            please contact Syncfusion support for technical assistance:
        </p>
        <a href="https://support.syncfusion.com/support/tickets/create" target="_blank">
            Contact Syncfusion Support
        </a>
    </div>
</div>